# Do not create pull requests

- Never create, open, or push GitHub pull requests.
- Never run `gh pr create` or equivalent PR commands unless the user explicitly asks in that message.
- The user will create all pull requests themselves.
- Commits, local branches, and other git work are still allowed when requested.
